The '''Antimony Research Lab''' (Japanese: '''アンチモニー研究所''' ''Antimony Research Institute'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Unova]] [[region]].

It appeared in ''[[BW011|A Home for Dwebble!]]'' as a facility where research on the [[Meteonite]] was being carried out. [[Pierce]] assigned [[Jessie]], [[James]], and {{MTR}} to investigate it and steal all of its data on the Meteonite. Later in the episode, the trio infiltrated the lab by skillfully evading its infrared sensor security. Using a remote-controlled device, James successfully downloaded all of the data on the lab's servers, which they later handed over to Pierce.

